  "body": "navigator.bluetooth.requestDevice is not detecting iBeacon (Ankhmaway Beacon iB001N & iB004N) in Google Chrome 54 (Mac OS X 10). Even though I have tried to filter all devices using https://googlechrome.github.io/samples/web-bluetooth/discover-services-and-characteristics.html. \r\n\r\nAre there requirements that bluetooth device (in my case Ankhmaway Beacon) needs to fulfil to be detectable in chrome browser using Web bluetooth API ? \r\n**FYI** in android we are able to detect our iBeacon using https://github.com/AltBeacon/android-beacon-library",
